{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_title", "source_sha256": "9134222ffa8f107bfe1686ff2def119cf308785253646c69c03a6e5d9161a1e5", "ja": "エンド・オブ・美咲ちゃんメーカー……？", "zh": "终结美咲制造机……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5932976f20ef5006113dc1691fefb825bc118aff021bb7299e32fdec91209caa", "ja": "全てを埋め尽くすほどのぬいぐるみを作り上\nげた美咲……と、プロデューサーが目覚める\nと、そこはいつも通りの劇場。ぬいぐるみは\n跡形もない。夢だったのだろうか？　それと\nも……？　答えはきっと、綿の中に……。", "zh": "做出了多得足以填满一切的毛绒玩偶的美咲……和制作人醒来\n后，映入眼帘的是一如往常的剧场。毛绒玩偶\n已经消失得无影无踪。那只是一场梦吗？还是\n说……？答案一定就在棉花之中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "aa50e59974372e975dbd35bf3a59ff3c57ba63b106db0249ca67f240ab5258d1", "ja": "うーん……ぬいぐるみ、作らないと……むにゃ。\nい……糸が、通らない……うう～……むにゃ……。", "zh": "唔……得做毛绒玩偶才行……呼噜。\n线……穿不过去……呜呜……呼噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "0ca980432d80c0e66749a10db42adccf1cacda4ad0a66d44eb8b9c6d7ed7831b", "ja": "……さん！\n{$P$}さん、起きてください！", "zh": "……先生！\n{$P$}先生，快醒醒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "47c8a318240c0b45910e9cc0e5310bd894139abb87f5fad240932919c6a15c56", "ja": "うわあっ！？", "zh": "唔哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "3a66f7c80798ebbb2400c4d21ea7fd56a0e5ec2d6e5e957a5bbd1894e878cdf3", "ja": "{$P$}さん、大丈夫ですか？\nずいぶん、うなされてましたけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你没事吧？\n刚才一直在做噩梦呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "864d607ea5dbc88801e61bcfef85e7c4fade6b465bf281516dad751f0181f462", "ja": "あ、青羽さん……青羽さんこそ、大丈夫ですか！？\nぬいぐるみは、納品はどうなりましたか！？", "zh": "啊，青羽小姐……青羽小姐才是，没事吧！？\n玩偶的交付情况怎么样了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "c05ed7e350bc2713e59dfea426f9057171b176989bf4a7286f25cfacc7593b10", "ja": "えっ。ぬいぐるみ、ですか？", "zh": "诶。玩偶，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "104f28427734b6553818bd2944008dd313a6b97bbcc7a6bb86c3b3bd17a4598d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、寝言でも\n「ぬいぐるみが……」って言ってましたよ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您说梦话时还念叨着“玩偶……”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "b690f8fe64d6068e0822d21d4f8b91acc1dceb030edb179545eee218141f99c6", "ja": "もしかして……\n何か、怖い夢でも見たんですか？", "zh": "难道说……\n您做了什么可怕的噩梦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "998412543018e909963aa31a6cf325810070b628bf6493b6cd1f12fef568aaf2", "ja": "夢？　……それじゃ、100万個のぬいぐるみを\n今日中に納品する仕事は……？", "zh": "梦？　……那今天内要交货\n100万个毛绒玩具的工作是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "cd6355e6e85a939af86937c0c9db9bb7ad33e2994d6651d0f059dae075a6255c", "ja": "765プロに、そんなお仕事は来ていませんよ。\nねえ、美咲ちゃん？", "zh": "765艺能可没有接到过这种工作哦。\n对吧，美咲？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "2df5a0c97c15069b1a802efd876f59775917eae1770be327cade8d4942ba2718", "ja": "はい！　でも、とっても楽しそうなお仕事ですね。\n本当にオファーがきたら、私もお手伝いしたいな～。", "zh": "好的！不过，这工作听起来真的很有意思呢。\n要是真的收到邀请，我也想帮忙～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "488e0830affd3907e166b539fee6a6d15babf987204754884e66d77e4a547b4d", "ja": "でも、そんなにたくさん作るのは無理そうね。\nその時は、ちゃんと業者さんを探しましょう。", "zh": "不过，要做那么多好像有点困难呢。\n到时候，我们还是好好找家专业公司吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1012_se", "source_sha256": "8b7b40215ba7d267db52f1bd54bd451a3c6eb91f8d183571f4fb9c05fc16b3d7", "ja": "ポトッ……", "zh": "扑通……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "e85933129b5fb1410bad8be79483bfa0dbfdaa9afb03a09ab12c4dccfa8c1080", "ja": "あら？　茜ちゃん人形が、どうしてここに……？\nふふっ。誰かがお見舞いに置いていったのかしら。", "zh": "咦？小茜玩偶，怎么会在这里……？\n呵呵，是有人来探病时放在这里的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6fe6b3afecb06ae9335f0bd7c33df6595afddf652234aa5084d41a45aabbb2fe", "ja": "茜の……人形……？　（ゾクッ……！）", "zh": "茜的……人偶……？（一阵寒意……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "052b21e044969a621738ace11aab710935bfdfee6d2496db7036d49cbdfa58ba", "ja": "（今、何か思い出しかけたような……。\nいや、気のせいだろう…………うん、気のせいだ！）", "zh": "（刚才，好像差一点就想起什么了……不，应该是我多心了…………嗯，一定是我多心了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "a2fc961a06431f3d20c68e7d693231fd3992542f685d257b1c30caf2fbd5b827", "ja": "{$P$}さん？\nやっぱり、無理しない方が……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生？\n果然还是不要勉强比较好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "1c07ddcd717a91a34da6948c592613be9cc87f6e90f9c65af98512bdbab0b4c2", "ja": "そうですよ。もう少し寝ててもいいんですよ？\n眠れないなら、私が、その～、ひ、ひざ……。", "zh": "是啊。再多睡一会儿也没关系哦？\n要是睡不着的话，我可以……那、那个，膝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2fee2c1e6f059d3ddbe69898af70cd20847c7a21480becce6a71e7aee5483aa8", "ja": "いえ、大丈夫……うわっ、もうこんな時間！？", "zh": "不，没关系……哇，已经这么晚了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "42030fa9843fa6e6b48a78d266a60701d02fdf3d0e22b17084e60a08ecb95814", "ja": "青羽さん、音無さん、ありがとうございました！\n失礼しますね！", "zh": "青羽小姐、音无小姐，谢谢你们！\n那我先告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1020_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d96d889094a4da1f364edd9561ccd21d0f3432a6261c158460e70fcddb3864d2", "ja": "（夢を見たはずだけど、ほとんど記憶にない。でも、\n一生懸命な青羽さんの姿だけは覚えているような……）", "zh": "（我应该做了个梦，但几乎完全不记得了。不过，似乎还记得青羽小姐努力的身影……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_602_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_602_ap_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "fddb480251f479dc27e401148b7ce8f8c0470f6609366a7e747a8e8af35fc41b", "ja": "（……眠ってスッキリしたし、仕事に戻ろう。\nアイドル達が待っているからな！）", "zh": "（……睡了一觉，精神好多了，回去工作吧。偶像们还在等着我呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
